<main class="panel billingSelfServicePage"><div class="pageTitle"><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT BILLING</span><h1>Subscription & billing</h1><p>Stripe securely handles payment methods and recurring charges. Annotated controls packages, membership, AI allowance, and access.</p></div>
